DESCRIPTION: GHØSTKID Follow The White Rabbit Tour Support: Dropout Kings\, Stain The Canvas\, Seven Blood 14. Oktober 2026 Viper Room Einlass: 18:00 Uhr | Beginn: 18:30 Uhr Tickets sind ab MI\, 24.06. 11:00 Uhr via oeticket.com! ______________________________________________________ GHØSTKID emerged in 2024 as an entity untamed\, unfiltered\, and resonating with raw\, unapologetic rebellion. They’ve captivated audiences worldwide and set new standards in the fusion of metal\, industrial\, goth\, and pop. 2024 has been a landmark year for the band. Their album HOLLYWOOD SUICIDE\, released on March 22nd\, 2024\, delivered a sonic onslaught of ferocious intensity and emotional depth. Each track tells a tale of anguish\, passion\, and unrelenting determination\, exploring the raw truths of life and the human psyche. Sculpted under the guidance of renowned producer Sky van Hoﬀ\, the album stands as a testament to GHØSTKID’s artistic fervor and singer Sushi’s personality. In 2024 GHØSTKID played 110+ shows\, including their first US tour\, supporting Black Veil Brides\, a EU tour supporting Blind Channel and their first European headliner tour\, Also they capped the year with a big hometown xmas show. Joined by musical conspirators Jappo Van Glory (guitar)\, Chris Canterbury (guitar)\, Stanislaw Czywil (bass)\, and Steve Joakim (drums)\, GHØSTKID creates more than just music—they craft a transformative\, soul-stirring experience. The band boldly ventures into new realms of expression\, weaving a tapestry of darkness and aggression Prepare to be consumed by the chaos. GHØSTKID is rebellion in its purest form—a visceral\, unrelenting journey into the darker realms of music and emotion. Embrace the chaos. ______________________________________________________ Tickets sind ab Mittwoch\, 24. Juni 2026 11:00 Uhr via oeticket.com und in allen bekannten Vorverkaufsstellen erhältlich!  
